/// Bandit.TransportError: an unrecoverable socket failure. The pipeline
/// catches it, emits the span stop and closes the connection; it has no
/// status (sendOnError: answers :ok for it).
///
/// The reason is in the message ("Unrecoverable error: ..."): exceptions
/// hold no instance state. Callers needing the reason as data (chunk:)
/// use the Result-returning socket operations instead of catching this.
typed Error subclass: TransportError
